],"Active":[""],"Fetching plugins from the WordPress directory\u2026":[""],"Made by bPlugins":[""],"Discover more plugins from our team":[""],"Hand-crafted WordPress plugins built with the same care and quality. Install any of them with a single click.":[""],"Search plugins\u2026":[""],"Sort by":[""],"Popular":[""],"Top Rated":[""],"A\u2013Z":[""],"<strong>%d<\/strong> plugin matching \"<search \/>\"":[""],"<strong>%d<\/strong> plugin":[""],"No plugins match":[""],"Try a different keyword.":[""],"%s out of 5":[""],"Video":[""],"Your browser does not support the video tag.":[""],"Pricing":[""],"Pick the plan that fits your project":[""],"Same powerful features on every plan \u2014 just choose how many sites you need. Upgrade or downgrade any time.":[""],"Same on every plan":[""],"Everything you get, on every license":[""],"Every feature is available on every license tier. The only difference is how many sites you can activate the plugin on.":[""],"14 days money back":[""],"Risk-free purchase":[""],"Lifetime updates":[""],"Plugins updates":[""],"On every plan":[""],"Priority support":[""],"Get help when you need it":[""],"Secure checkout":[""],"Powered by Freemius":[""],"Can I upgrade my plan later?":[""],"Yes \u2014 you can upgrade any time from your account. We prorate the difference automatically.":[""],"Will I receive updates if I purchase a lifetime license?":[""],"Yes, a lifetime license holds lifetime updates and never expires, ensuring you always have access to the latest features and bug fixes without recurring fees.":[""],"What happens after my license expires?":[""],"The plugin keeps working forever. You only lose access to premium features, updates and premium support unless you renew.":[""],"Do you offer refunds?":[""],"Absolutely. Every plan is backed by a 14 days no-questions-asked money-back guarantee.":[""],"Unlimited Sites":[""],"Single Site":[""],"%d Site":[""],"For agencies & enterprise":[""],"For solo creators":[""],"For freelancers":[""],"Most Popular":[""],"\u2248 $%s per site":[""],"Use on every site you build.":[""],"Billed yearly \u00b7 $%s\/mo":[""],"One-time payment, pay once forever.":[""],"Billed monthly, cancel anytime.":[""],"No plans available right now.":[""],"Frequently asked questions":[""],"\/mo":[""],"\/yr":[""],"Loading the latest pricing\u2026":[""],"Danger Zone":[""],"Delete plugin data on uninstall":[""],"When enabled, every piece of %s data is wiped from your database the moment the plugin is uninstalled.":[""],"What will be permanently deleted:":[""],"This action cannot be undone. Deactivating the plugin alone is non-destructive \u2014 your data is only deleted when you also click \"Delete\" on the plugins screen.":[""],"Toggle data deletion on uninstall":[""],"Deletion is ON":[""],"Deletion is OFF":[""],"Data will be removed on uninstall":[""],"Data will be preserved on uninstall":[""],"Saving\u2026":[""],"Dismiss":[""],"Enable data deletion on uninstall?":[""],"Close":[""],"Switching this on means that the next time this plugin is uninstalled, all data, configurations, and settings will be permanently removed from your database.":[""],"There is no recovery once data is deleted. Make sure you have a recent backup.":[""],"Type <code>DELETE<\/code> to confirm":[""],"Cancel":[""],"Enable deletion":[""],"Failed to save setting.":[""],"All plugin posts and custom post types":[""],"Plugin settings and options":[""],"Layout configuration and meta data":[""],"Taxonomy terms and associations":[""],"All tracking and analytics data":[""],"Settings":[""],"Manage plugin preferences":[""],"Control how %s behaves on your site. Destructive options live in their own clearly-marked zone.":[""],"Data deletion is enabled":[""],"Your data is protected":[""],"All plugin data will be permanently removed if the plugin is uninstalled.":[""],"Even if you deactivate or uninstall the plugin, your settings and data stay intact.":[""],"Release Notes(Changelog)...":[""],"Watch Tutorial":[""],"Getting Started":[""],"Pick how you'd like to start with the plugin - the steps below adapt to your workflow.":[""],"Read the %s Documentation":[""],"Read the Full Documentation":[""],"Browse guides, settings reference, and examples for every feature.":[""],"Read Documentation \u2192":[""],"Need any Assistance?":[""],"Our Expert Support Team is always ready to help you out promptly.":[""],"Contact Support":[""],"Join Our Community":[""],"Get tutorials, plugin updates, feature announcements, and support from other WordPress users.":[""],"Join Now \u2192":[""],"Request a Feature":[""],"Have an idea that would make this plugin even better? Let us know \u2014 we love hearing from you.":[""],"Submit Request \u2192":[""],"Loving This Plugin? \u2b50":[""],"We're a small team pouring our heart into this plugin \u2014 your honest review keeps us going and helps others discover it. It only takes 30 seconds.":[""],"Leave a Review":[""],"Read Documentation":[""],"View Demos":[""],"Upgrade to Pro":[""],"Close video":[""],"%s walkthrough":[""],"Plugin active":[""],"Pro Plan":[""],"Free Plan":[""],"Welcome to %s":[""],"Hi <strong>%s<\/strong>,":[""],"Play product walkthrough":[""],"Watch quick start \u00b7 2 min":[""],"Go %s Pro & Unlock More!":[""],"View Pricing Plan":[""],"%s Pro features":[""],"Default":[""],"Animation":[""],"Button":[""],"Download Button":[""],"Feature Comparison":[""],"Welcome":[""],"Demos":[""],"Paste Anywhere":[""],"Paste the copied shortcode (e.g. <code>[btn_block id=123]<\/code>) into any post, page, widget area, or layout using the <strong>Shortcode<\/strong> block.":[""],"Design Stylish, Interactive, and Multi-Functional Buttons":[""],"Go to <strong>Button Block &rsaquo; Add New<\/strong>, design your button, and publish it. Copy the shortcode <code>[btn_block id=YOUR_ID]<\/code> from the list table.":[""],"Get multi-functional buttons. The Button Block plugin comes up with many useful styling options that make you happy to build responsive, interactive, stylish buttons in a few clicks.":[""],"Add Shortcode Widget":[""],"Open the Elementor editor on any page. Search for the <strong>Shortcode<\/strong> widget and drag it to your desired section\/column.":[""],"Enter & Preview":[""],"Paste your shortcode (e.g. <code>[btn_block id=123]<\/code>) into the Shortcode input box to preview the stylized button live on the canvas.":[""],"Theme \/ PHP":[""],"Create a Button Post":[""],"Go to <strong>Button Block &rsaquo; Add New<\/strong>, customize your button, and copy the shortcode <code>[btn_block id=YOUR_ID]<\/code> from the post list.":[""],"Button Block Generator":[""],"Open Theme File":[""],"Open the PHP template file in your theme where you want the button to appear (e.g. <code>header.php<\/code>, <code>footer.php<\/code>, <code>single.php<\/code>, or custom template files).":[""],"Render via do_shortcode":[""],"Add <code>&lt;?php echo do_shortcode('[btn_block id=YOUR_ID]'); ?&gt;<\/code> (replace <em>YOUR_ID<\/em> with the actual post ID) to render the button.":[""],"View More Changelogs":[""],"Popup with image, video, docs, or blocks.":[""],"Protect a button by password, email, or role.":[""],"Collect and browse captured email leads.":[""],"Set a custom file name for the download.":[""],"Add rel and referrer policy attributes.":[""],"Place the icon and tooltip on any side.":[""],"Hide the button on desktop, tablet, or mobile.":[""],"See All Demos":[""],"Tooltip":[""],"Icon":[""],"Customize":[""],"Animations":[""],"Popup":[""],"Buy Now \u279c":[""],"Best Value":[""],"All shortcode posts (button-block post type)":[""],"Plugin settings":[""],"Start Now":[""],"Styling":[""],"Features":[""],"Add the Button Block":[""],"Open the block editor on any post or page. Click the <strong>+<\/strong> icon in the top-left corner or type <strong>\/Button Block<\/strong> to find and insert the Button Block.":[""],"Open Editor":[""],"Customize Style":[""],"Use the block settings in the sidebar to style your button. You can choose layouts, customize alignment, add hover effects, set typography, adjust border-radius, background, and text colors.":[""],"Configure Button Action":[""],"Configure what happens when a user clicks the button. Set the link URL, choose whether it opens a popup (Pro), triggers a file download (Pro), or set custom rel attributes and referrer policies.":[""],"Style & Publish":[""],"Use the design controls to customize hover states, custom shadows, and animations. When satisfied, publish or update the page.":[""],"ShortCode":[""],"Open Button Block Generator":[""],"Go to <strong>Button Block &rsaquo; Add New<\/strong> (or the Button Block CPT list) in your WordPress admin menu to create a reusable button.":[""],"Configure the Block":[""],"In the editor, design and customize your button using the block options in the sidebar. Give it a title for easy reference and publish it.":[""],"Copy the Shortcode":[""],"After publishing, go to the <strong>Button Block<\/strong> list table. You will see a <strong>ShortCode<\/strong> column displaying <code>[btn_block id=POST_ID]<\/code>. Click it to copy to your clipboard.":[""]}}}